{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%@ can also take the volume and brightness keys. If Cranny's HUD doesn't appear, turn off the HUD in that app." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ HUD: warning while ONE known app with its own HUD runs; argument is its name, such as MonitorControl",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ тоже может перехватывать клавиши громкости и яркости. Если индикатор Cranny не появляется, выключите индикатор в этом приложении."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ can also take the volume and brightness keys. If Cranny's HUD doesn't appear, turn off the HUD in these apps." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ HUD: warning while SEVERAL known apps with their own HUD run; argument is a list of names, such as “MonitorControl and SoundSource”",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ тоже могут перехватывать клавиши громкости и яркости. Если индикатор Cranny не появляется, выключите индикатор в этих приложениях."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accent" : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ HUD ▸ Colors: bar in the accent colour",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Акцент"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accent for volume, yellow for brightness, blue for the keyboard." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ HUD: footnote explaining the Semantic colours",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Акцентный для громкости, жёлтый для яркости, синий для клавиатуры."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After the sound output changes, the next volume HUD shows the new device." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ HUD: footnote under Show output device",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "После смены аудиовыхода индикатор громкости покажет новое устройство."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always shown with Differentiate without color." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ HUD: footnote under Show value (macOS Accessibility ▸ Display setting)",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Всегда виден, если включено «Дифференцировать без цвета»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Brightness" : {
      "comment" : "HUD: what the HUD shows (VoiceOver label, peek title, Settings ▸ HUD toggle)",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Яркость"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Brightness, %@" : {
      "comment" : "HUD: VoiceOver announcement once the level settles; argument is a percentage",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Яркость, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Built-in display only. Other displays keep the macOS HUD." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ HUD: footnote under Brightness",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Только встроенный дисплей. На других дисплеях остаётся индикатор macOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changed from the default" : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ HUD: tooltip of the dot before a changed row",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Отличается от стандартного"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Colors" : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ HUD: picker for the level bar's colour",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Цвета"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cranny draws its HUD only when it can hide the one macOS shows. Without Accessibility, macOS keeps its own HUD and Cranny shows none." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ HUD: footnote under Replace the system HUD (why Accessibility is needed)",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cranny показывает свой индикатор, только когда может скрыть индикатор macOS. Без универсального доступа остаётся индикатор macOS, а Cranny свой не показывает."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cranny handles the keys now." : {
